  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion and capsicum.\n• Drain and rinse kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61ee1f5e4bf9af004f0cde9d/step-96f17961.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and capsicum, stirring, until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Add BBQ spice blend (add less if you're sensitive to heat!), beans, tomato paste, the water, salt, brown sugar, butter and 1/2 the diced tomatoes and stir to combine. Simmer until thickened slightly, 2-3 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61ee1f5e4bf9af004f0cde9d/step-eea6a129.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high.\n• Lay mini flour tortillas on a flat surface. Divide bean mixture between tortillas (about 1/2 cup each). Roll up tightly and place seam-side down, in a baking dish, ensuring they fit snugly.\n• Pour remaining diced tomatoes over rolled tortillas. Sprinkle with cheese and grill until warmed through and cheese is golden, 6-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61ee1f5e4bf9af004f0cde9d/step-ba42bd71.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Chop tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, salad leaves and a light drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste and toss to combine.\n• Divide the enchiladas between plates and top with sour cream. Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61ee1f5e4bf9af004f0cde9d/step-f2131fe5.jpg"
    }
  ]
